{
  "step_id": "step_5_emotion",
  "step_name": "生成情绪曲线",
  "step_type": "conversation",
  "description": "基于战术规划生成详细的情绪曲线",
  "order": 5,
  "input_steps": ["step_4_tactical"],
  "output_key": "emotion_curve",
  "prompt_template": {
    "system_prompt": "你是一位精通网文节奏的爽点设计大师。你的任务是基于战术规划，生成详细的情绪曲线。\n\n你需要设计：\n1. 每章的情绪、节拍类型、强度\n2. 爽点类型（打脸/收获/升级/装逼/震惊）和具体场景\n3. 钩子类型和内容\n4. 与阶段目标的对齐\n\n## 节奏设计要求\n- 情绪曲线必须有起伏，避免平铺直叙\n- 每3-5章一个小高潮，每10章一个大高潮\n- 爽点要多样化，避免重复\n- 钩子要吸引人，让读者欲罢不能",
    "context_sections": [
      {
        "name": "剧情设定",
        "type": "dynamic",
        "template": "{plot_settings}",
        "description": "完整剧情设定信息"
      },
      {
        "name": "战术大纲",
        "type": "dynamic",
        "template": "{tactical_plan}",
        "description": "战术大纲内容"
      },
      {
        "name": "阶段目标",
        "type": "dynamic", 
        "template": "{phase_goals}",
        "description": "当前阶段的具体目标"
      },
      {
        "name": "输出要求",
        "type": "static",
        "content": "## 📝 你需要生成\n\n### 1. 情绪曲线\n每章包含：\n- chapter_number：章节号\n- emotion：情绪类型\n- intensity：强度（1-10）\n- beat_type：节拍类型（铺垫/冲突/反转/渲染/伏笔）\n- climax_type：爽点类型（打脸/收获/升级/装逼/震惊，非爽点章留空）\n- climax_subtype：具体场景（如'前女友打脸'，非爽点章留空）\n- event：主要事件简述\n- purpose：本章目的\n- hook_type：钩子类型\n- hook_content：钩子内容\n- stage_goal_alignment：与阶段目标的对齐\n\n### 2. 阶段目标详情\n每个阶段包含：\n- goal_id：目标ID（如G1）\n- chapter_range：章节范围\n- description：目标描述\n- deliverables：可交付成果列表\n- milestones：关键里程碑",
        "editable": true,
        "description": "情绪曲线和阶段目标输出要求"
      },
      {
        "name": "输出格式",
        "type": "static",
        "content": "## ✅ 输出格式\nJSON格式，包含chapters数组和stage_goals对象",
        "editable": true,
        "description": "输出格式"
      }
    ],
    "variables": [
      {"name": "climax_formula", "type": "object", "required": false, "description": "高潮公式"},
      {"name": "total_chapters", "type": "number", "required": false, "default": 30, "description": "生成的章节数"}
    ]
  },
  "response_format": {
    "type": "json",
    "schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "chapters": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "chapter_number": {"type": "integer"},
              "emotion": {"type": "string"},
              "intensity": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 10},
              "beat_type": {"type": "string"},
              "climax_type": {"type": "string"},
              "climax_subtype": {"type": "string"},
              "event": {"type": "string"},
              "purpose": {"type": "string"},
              "hook_type": {"type": "string"},
              "hook_content": {"type": "string"},
              "stage_goal_alignment": {"type": "string"}
            },
            "required": ["chapter_number", "emotion", "intensity", "beat_type", "event", "purpose", "hook_type", "hook_content", "stage_goal_alignment"]
          }
        },
        "stage_goals": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "goal_id": {"type": "string"},
              "chapter_range": {"type": "string"},
              "description": {"type": "string"},
              "deliverables": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
              "milestones": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}
            },
            "required": ["goal_id", "chapter_range", "description", "deliverables", "milestones"]
          }
        }
      },
      "required": ["chapters", "stage_goals"]
    }
  },
  "ai_settings": {
    "model": "claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
    "temperature": 0.7,
    "max_tokens": 8000
  },
  "fallback_enabled": true,
  "retry_policy": {
    "max_retries": 3,
    "retry_delay": 2
  }
}
